{"id":"vol8-07","section":1,"path":"bank/listening/vol8-07/audio-1.m4a","model":"small","duration":406.54,"segments":[{"start":0.0,"end":4.02,"text":"Recordings, and you will have to answer questions on what you hear.","words":[["Recordings,",0.0,0.74],["and",1.12,1.38],["you",1.38,1.54],["will",1.54,1.66],["have",1.66,1.84],["to",1.84,1.98],["answer",1.98,2.3],["questions",2.3,2.86],["on",2.86,3.26],["what",3.26,3.44],["you",3.44,3.64],["hear.",3.64,4.02]]},{"start":4.94,"end":9.88,"text":"There will be time for you to read the instructions and questions, and you will have a chance","words":[["There",4.94,5.24],["will",5.24,5.38],["be",5.38,5.54],["time",5.54,5.86],["for",5.86,6.14],["you",6.14,6.24],["to",6.24,6.36],["read",6.36,6.68],["the",6.68,6.9],["instructions",6.9,7.44],["and",7.44,7.72],["questions,",7.72,8.1],["and",8.72,9.04],["you",9.04,9.2],["will",9.2,9.32],["have",9.32,9.46],["a",9.46,9.62],["chance",9.62,9.88]]},{"start":9.88,"end":11.02,"text":"to check your work.","words":[["to",9.88,10.1],["check",10.1,10.44],["your",10.44,10.62],["work.",10.62,11.02]]},{"start":12.18,"end":15.34,"text":"All the recordings will be played once only.","words":[["All",12.18,12.38],["the",12.38,12.5],["recordings",12.5,12.94],["will",12.94,13.54],["be",13.54,13.68],["played",13.68,14.14],["once",14.14,14.7],["only.",14.7,15.34]]},{"start":16.7,"end":19.1,"text":"The test is in four parts.","words":[["The",16.7,16.88],["test",16.88,17.28],["is",17.28,18.0],["in",18.0,18.14],["four",18.14,18.5],["parts.",18.5,19.1]]},{"start":19.84,"end":23.14,"text":"Write all your answers in the listening question booklet.","words":[["Write",19.84,20.16],["all",20.16,20.46],["your",20.46,20.62],["answers",20.62,21.04],["in",21.04,21.72],["the",21.72,21.86],["listening",21.86,22.18],["question",22.18,22.68],["booklet.",22.68,23.14]]},{"start":23.96,"end":29.46,"text":"At the end of the test, you will be given ten minutes to transfer your answers to an","words":[["At",23.96,24.46],["the",24.46,24.58],["end",24.58,24.8],["of",24.8,24.94],["the",24.94,25.02],["test,",25.02,25.38],["you",25.74,26.02],["will",26.02,26.16],["be",26.16,26.3],["given",26.3,26.58],["ten",26.58,26.98],["minutes",26.98,27.42],["to",27.42,27.74],["transfer",27.74,28.34],["your",28.34,28.56],["answers",28.56,28.98],["to",28.98,29.28],["an",29.28,29.46]]},{"start":29.46,"end":36.38,"text":"answer sheet. Now turn to part one on page two of your question booklet.","words":[["answer",29.46,29.76],["sheet.",29.76,30.06],["Now",32.18,32.54],["turn",32.54,32.78],["to",32.78,33.02],["part",33.02,33.24],["one",33.24,33.7],["on",33.7,34.46],["page",34.46,34.86],["two",34.86,35.32],["of",35.32,35.5],["your",35.5,35.62],["question",35.62,35.94],["booklet.",35.94,36.38]]},{"start":41.55,"end":48.93,"text":"Part one. You will hear a conversation between a travel agent and a client in a travel agency.","words":[["Part",41.55,41.83],["one.",41.83,42.31],["You",43.45,43.81],["will",43.81,44.01],["hear",44.01,44.17],["a",44.17,44.31],["conversation",44.31,45.01],["between",45.01,45.47],["a",45.47,45.73],["travel",45.73,45.95],["agent",45.95,46.33],["and",46.33,46.91],["a",46.91,47.07],["client",47.07,47.47],["in",47.47,47.99],["a",47.99,48.11],["travel",48.11,48.39],["agency.",48.39,48.93]]},{"start":49.99,"end":76.37,"text":"First, you have some time to look at questions one to four. Now listen carefully and answer","words":[["First,",49.99,50.37],["you",50.83,50.99],["have",50.99,51.13],["some",51.13,51.31],["time",51.31,51.69],["to",51.69,51.91],["look",51.91,52.05],["at",52.05,52.17],["questions",52.17,52.59],["one",52.59,53.33],["to",53.33,53.73],["four.",53.73,54.21],["Now",74.59,74.79],["listen",74.79,75.09],["carefully",75.09,75.51],["and",75.51,76.09],["answer",76.09,76.37]]},{"start":76.37,"end":82.4,"text":"questions one to four. Good morning.","words":[["questions",76.37,76.87],["one",76.87,77.55],["to",77.55,78.01],["four.",78.01,78.49],["Good",81.74,82.14],["morning.",82.14,82.4]]},{"start":82.4,"end":86.04,"text":"Hello. Could you help me with a quote for a visit to Australia?","words":[["Hello.",82.4,83.12],["Could",83.64,83.94],["you",83.94,84.14],["help",84.14,84.36],["me",84.36,84.52],["with",84.52,84.68],["a",84.68,84.78],["quote",84.78,84.98],["for",84.98,85.2],["a",85.2,85.36],["visit",85.36,85.44],["to",85.44,85.64],["Australia?",85.64,86.04]]},{"start":86.56,"end":87.7,"text":"Yes. Have a seat.","words":[["Yes.",86.56,86.82],["Have",87.16,87.3],["a",87.3,87.48],["seat.",87.48,87.7]]},{"start":88.56,"end":92.78,"text":"Now, if I could get a name from you first, then I can set up a quotation form.","words":[["Now,",88.56,88.78],["if",88.94,89.18],["I",89.18,89.3],["could",89.3,89.44],["get",89.44,89.58],["a",89.58,89.68],["name",89.68,89.96],["from",89.96,90.18],["you",90.18,90.38],["first,",90.38,90.88],["then",91.06,91.2],["I",91.2,91.32],["can",91.32,91.42],["set",91.42,91.62],["up",91.62,91.76],["a",91.76,91.86],["quotation",91.86,92.3],["form.",92.3,92.78]]},{"start":93.1,"end":95.58,"text":"Great. The family name is Thorn.","words":[["Great.",93.1,93.34],["The",93.8,94.02],["family",94.02,94.46],["name",94.46,94.76],["is",94.76,95.1],["Thorn.",95.1,95.58]]},{"start":96.04,"end":97.88,"text":"T-H-O-R-N?","words":[["T",96.04,96.26],["-H",96.26,96.74],["-O",96.74,97.1],["-R",97.1,97.48],["-N?",97.48,97.88]]},{"start":98.1,"end":98.46,"text":"Yes.","words":[["Yes.",98.1,98.46]]},{"start":98.68,"end":99.04,"text":"Right.","words":[["Right.",98.68,99.04]]},{"start":99.86,"end":104.16,"text":"Now, we'd be looking at going during the school holidays, the mid-year ones.","words":[["Now,",99.86,100.08],["we'd",100.34,100.74],["be",100.74,100.84],["looking",100.84,101.12],["at",101.12,101.34],["going",101.34,101.56],["during",101.56,101.86],["the",101.86,102.08],["school",102.08,102.4],["holidays,",102.4,102.94],["the",103.42,103.54],["mid",103.54,103.72],["-year",103.72,103.9],["ones.",103.9,104.16]]},{"start":104.46,"end":105.76,"text":"That's June then, is it?","words":[["That's",104.46,104.84],["June",104.84,105.24],["then,",105.24,105.48],["is",105.58,105.62],["it?",105.62,105.76]]},{"start":106.0,"end":107.42,"text":"No, it's July this year.","words":[["No,",106.0,106.3],["it's",106.4,106.64],["July",106.64,106.9],["this",106.9,107.18],["year.",107.18,107.42]]},{"start":107.76,"end":110.4,"text":"Okay. And what dates are you thinking of?","words":[["Okay.",107.76,108.24],["And",108.62,108.94],["what",108.94,109.16],["dates",109.16,109.56],["are",109.56,109.74],["you",109.74,109.84],["thinking",109.84,110.08],["of?",110.08,110.4]]},{"start":110.4,"end":117.6,"text":"Let me see. We want to go for five days and we could go any time from the first to the","words":[["Let",110.4,111.18],["me",111.18,111.4],["see.",111.4,111.84],["We",112.2,112.46],["want",112.46,112.76],["to",112.76,113.0],["go",113.0,113.14],["for",113.14,113.32],["five",113.32,113.74],["days",113.74,114.12],["and",114.12,114.84],["we",114.84,115.02],["could",115.02,115.16],["go",115.16,115.32],["any",115.32,115.6],["time",115.6,115.9],["from",115.9,116.18],["the",116.18,116.36],["first",116.36,116.92],["to",116.92,117.44],["the",117.44,117.6]]},{"start":117.6,"end":123.48,"text":"fourteenth. Right. And whereabouts in Australia are you thinking of? We were thinking of flying","words":[["fourteenth.",117.6,118.02],["Right.",118.32,118.72],["And",119.28,119.78],["whereabouts",119.78,120.54],["in",120.54,120.76],["Australia",120.76,121.16],["are",121.16,121.48],["you",121.48,121.52],["thinking",121.52,121.82],["of?",121.82,122.12],["We",122.5,122.74],["were",122.74,122.86],["thinking",122.86,123.08],["of",123.08,123.3],["flying",123.3,123.48]]},{"start":123.48,"end":129.42,"text":"to Brisbane and then staying somewhere near there. So the Gold Coast then. That's a lovely","words":[["to",123.48,123.68],["Brisbane",123.68,123.98],["and",123.98,124.44],["then",124.44,124.64],["staying",124.64,124.94],["somewhere",124.94,125.28],["near",