4],["your",146.34,146.48],["own",146.48,146.6],["space.",146.6,146.9],["Yes",147.3,147.62],["I'll",147.62,148.42],["have",148.42,148.54],["a",148.54,148.64],["look",148.64,148.74],["at",148.74,148.88],["what",148.88,149.0]]},{"start":149.0,"end":156.83,"text":"we've got. Before you hear the rest of the conversation you have some time to","words":[["we've",149.0,149.26],["got.",149.26,149.52],["Before",153.13,153.37],["you",153.37,153.61],["hear",153.61,153.83],["the",153.83,153.97],["rest",153.97,154.21],["of",154.21,154.35],["the",154.35,154.43],["conversation",154.43,155.01],["you",155.01,155.79],["have",155.79,156.01],["some",156.01,156.23],["time",156.23,156.57],["to",156.57,156.83]]},{"start":156.83,"end":207.61,"text":"look at questions 5 to 10. Now listen and answer questions 5 to 10. And will this","words":[["look",156.83,156.97],["at",156.97,157.11],["questions",157.11,157.55],["5",157.55,158.27],["to",158.27,158.81],["10.",158.81,159.29],["Now",199.67,200.01],["listen",200.01,200.37],["and",200.37,200.85],["answer",200.85,201.13],["questions",201.13,201.61],["5",201.61,202.39],["to",202.39,202.87],["10.",202.87,203.35],["And",206.67,207.09],["will",207.09,207.39],["this",207.39,207.61]]},{"start":207.61,"end":210.97,"text":"brochure you're going to give me detail what sightseeing there is to do? Oh","words":[["brochure",207.61,207.99],["you're",207.99,208.17],["going",208.17,208.25],["to",208.25,208.35],["give",208.35,208.49],["me",208.49,208.67],["detail",208.67,209.03],["what",209.03,209.35],["sightseeing",209.35,209.87],["there",209.87,210.03],["is",210.03,210.17],["to",210.17,210.29],["do?",210.29,210.47],["Oh",210.71,210.97]]},{"start":210.97,"end":215.15,"text":"yes there's lots of information in there about the amusement parks. The","words":[["yes",210.97,211.31],["there's",211.31,211.95],["lots",211.95,212.17],["of",212.17,212.35],["information",212.35,212.65],["in",212.65,213.01],["there",213.01,213.19],["about",213.19,213.43],["the",213.43,213.61],["amusement",213.61,213.97],["parks.",213.97,214.49],["The",214.93,215.15]]},{"start":215.15,"end":220.89,"text":"The three main ones are Dream World, which has some scary rollercoaster rides, as well","words":[["The",215.15,215.23],["three",215.23,215.47],["main",215.47,215.77],["ones",215.77,216.13],["are",216.13,216.73],["Dream",216.73,217.23],["World,",217.23,217.61],["which",217.93,218.11],["has",218.11,218.31],["some",218.31,218.49],["scary",218.49,218.99],["rollercoaster",218.99,219.83],["rides,",219.83,220.27],["as",220.73,220.75],["well",220.75,220.89]]},{"start":220.89,"end":221.67,"text":"as Zoo Animals.","words":[["as",220.89,221.05],["Zoo",221.05,221.27],["Animals.",221.27,221.67]]},{"start":221.95,"end":223.95,"text":"So that one sounds okay for all ages.","words":[["So",221.95,222.23],["that",222.23,222.57],["one",222.57,222.73],["sounds",222.73,223.01],["okay",223.01,223.33],["for",223.33,223.49],["all",223.49,223.65],["ages.",223.65,223.95]]},{"start":224.41,"end":224.65,"text":"Right.","words":[["Right.",224.41,224.65]]},{"start":225.07,"end":229.73,"text":"Well, there's also Water World, which is full of Hydra slides and wave pools.","words":[["Well,",225.07,225.37],["there's",225.47,225.63],["also",225.63,225.97],["Water",225.97,226.31],["World,",226.31,226.75],["which",226.93,227.21],["is",227.21,227.39],["full",227.39,227.61],["of",227.61,227.75],["Hydra",227.75,228.21],["slides",228.21,228.63],["and",228.63,229.11],["wave",229.11,229.41],["pools.",229.41,229.73]]},{"start":229.97,"end":230.77,"text":"They like that better.","words":[["They",229.97,230.03],["like",230.03,230.25],["that",230.25,230.47],["better.",230.47,230.77]]},{"start":230.89,"end":231.73,"text":"They're all keen on swimming.","words":[["They're",230.89,231.01],["all",231.01,231.13],["keen",231.13,231.29],["on",231.29,231.45],["swimming.",231.45,231.73]]},{"start":232.15,"end":232.33,"text":"Yeah.","words":[["Yeah.",232.15,232.33]]},{"start":232.89,"end":238.05,"text":"And then there's also Movie World, which has actors dressed up as famous film characters.","words":[["And",232.89,233.21],["then",233.21,233.41],["there's",233.41,233.65],["also",233.65,233.95],["Movie",233.95,234.33],["World,",234.33,234.85],["which",235.03,235.33],["has",235.33,235.53],["actors",235.53,235.95],["dressed",235.95,236.41],["up",236.41,236.69],["as",236.69,236.83],["famous",236.83,237.13],["film",237.13,237.49],["characters.",237.49,238.05]]},{"start":238.37,"end":240.63,"text":"My kids don't watch much TV or video.","words":[["My",238.37,238.77],["kids",238.77,239.07],["don't",239.07,239.33],["watch",239.33,239.53],["much",239.53,239.79],["TV",239.79,240.09],["or",240.09,240.33],["video.",240.33,240.63]]},{"start":241.19,"end":242.93,"text":"I don't think they'd be so into that.","words":[["I",241.19,241.39],["don't",241.39,241.69],["think",241.69,241.85],["they'd",241.85,242.09],["be",242.09,242.19],["so",242.19,242.43],["into",242.43,242.61],["that.",242.61,242.93]]},{"start":243.53,"end":248.51,"text":"While we're talking about entertainment, I can recommend the local wildlife sanctuary.","words":[["While",243.53,244.03],["we're",244.03,244.31],["talking",244.31,244.57],["about",244.57,244.87],["entertainment,",244.87,245.49],["I",245.91,246.13],["can",246.13,246.31],["recommend",246.31,246.69],["the",246.69,246.91],["local",246.91,247.19],["wildlife",247.19,247.87],["sanctuary.",247.87,248.51]]},{"start":249.01,"end":252.19,"text":"You can see all kinds of creatures there and get some good photographs.","words":[["You",249.01,249.19],["can",249.19,249.33],["see",249.33,249.47],["all",249.47,249.73],["kinds",249.73,249.89],["of",249.89,250.15],["creatures",250.15,250.47],["there",250.47,250.97],["and",250.97,251.23],["get",251.23,251.35],["some",251.35,251.51],["good",251.51,251.69],["photographs.",251.69,252.19]]},{"start":252.69,"end":253.71,"text":"Do they have koalas?","words":[["Do",252.69,252.85],["they",252.85,252.99],["have",252.99,253.15],["koalas?",253.15,253.71]]},{"start":254.25,"end":259.67,"text":"Yes, but they're usually asleep and hidden in the treetops during the day, but the crocodiles","words":[["Yes,",254.25,254.65],["but",254.81,254.97],["they're",254.97,255.15],["usually",255.15,255.41],["asleep",255.41,256.03],["and",256.03,256.41],["hidden",256.41,256.61],["in",256.61,256.81],["the",256.81,256.91],["treetops",256.91,257.35],["during",257.35,257.75],["the",257.75,257.91],["day,",257.91,258.23],["but",258.45,258.77],["the",258.77,258.91],["crocodiles",258.91,259.67]]},{"start":259.67,"end":260.39,"text":"are amazing.","words":[["are",259.67,259.87],["amazing.",259.87,260.39]]},{"start":260.91,"end":263.97,"text":"It's easy to get right up to the fence to get close-ups of them.","words":[["It's",260.91,261.13],["easy",261.13,261.37],["to",261.37,261.53],["get",261.53,261.65],["right",261.65,261.93],["up",261.93,262.17],["to",262.17,262.35],["the",262.35,262.45],["fence",262.45,262.79],["to",262.79,263.01],["get",263.01,263.11],["close",263.11,263.37],["-ups",263.37,263.59],["of",263.59,263.81],["them.",263.81,263.97]]},{"start":264.25,"end":265.55,"text":"I suppose they're kangaroos?","words":[["I",264.25,264.45],["suppose",264.45,264.67],["they're",264.67,264.93],["kangaroos?",264.93,265.55]]},{"start":265.99,"end":270.41,"text":"Yes, but they're kept in a distant paddock, so it can be quite hard to spot.","words":[["Yes,",265.99,266.41],["but",266.55,266.73],["they're",266.73,267.05],["kept",267.05,267.23],["in",267.23,267.45],["a",267.45,267.57],["distant",267.57,267.87],["paddock,",267.87,268.49],["so",268.59,268.91],["it",268.91,269.17],["can",269.17,269.27],["be",269.27,269.37],["quite",269.37,269.59],["hard",269.59,269.85],["to",269.85,270.03],["spot.",270.03,270.41]]},{"start":270.41,"end":275.45,"text":"certainly sounds as if you know the place well yeah I've been many times now","words":[["certainly",270.41,271.23],["sounds",271.23,271.47],["as",271.47,271.63],["if",271.63,271.75],